BenchBuddy (the firmware, web interface, documentation and the BenchBuddy
Dock CAD files in this repository) is not open source yet.

You're welcome to:
  - read the code and files in this repository
  - build, flash and print BenchBuddy for your own personal use while
    taking part in the beta
  - suggest changes through issues and pull requests

Please don't, without written permission:
  - share, re-upload or redistribute these files or builds of them
  - sell BenchBuddy units, kits, docks or anything made from these files
  - publish modified versions

A proper open license may come later. Ask in the BenchBuddy channel or open
an issue if you want to do something not covered here.

Third-party parts keep their own licenses:
  - Fonts in web/fonts/ are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
    (see web/fonts/FONT_LICENSES.txt)
  - Libraries that PlatformIO downloads at build time (ESPAsyncWebServer,
    AsyncTCP, ArduinoJson, the ESP32 Arduino core) keep their own licenses
